{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7","agentId":"a7741c394a61d5aa4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 nauty / saucy / bliss / Traces 等图自同构工具对 SAT/CSP/MIP 模型的自动对称检测+破缺，2024-2026 进展。\n\n**背景：** Round 2 a96266f5aed302928 提\"99% 已实现 (grouped encoding + signature monotonic)，只剩 D₄\"。但那是手工对称破缺。自动检测可能发现手工没发现的对称群。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. nauty / saucy / bliss / Traces 工具对比\n2. SCIP-Symmetry / Symmetry Handler 现状\n3. CP-SAT 是否已经做自动对称检测（perron 文档）\n4. 把 master_model 转 colored graph 让 saucy/bliss 找群的可行性\n5. 找到群后破缺方法（lex-leader / orbital fixing）\n6. 工程成本（输出 master 的 colored graph 表达）\n\n输出末尾：\"是否值得花 1 周做\""},"uuid":"218f1ed9-1849-4582-adb4-854b72c056b8","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:25:14.380Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
