{"parentUuid":"e613f6e8-9199-4943-a96f-47bbfecce856","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a7741c394a61d5aa4","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01FfpbXZm9QKgmxjWyMYAhaZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018jdWd9Q1Bgv2B8UWPsGg3L","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/main/ortools/sat/symmetry.h","prompt":"CP-SAT 是如何检测和使用对称的？是否调用外部工具如 nauty/bliss/saucy？提到的算法、具体策略、限制（如时间限制）？"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5279,"cache_read_input_tokens":27631,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5279,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaozbvF4j3AqZn3ymjFP7","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"ca64ffd7-b5f5-4d74-9fac-db75ed175cfb","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:25:51.039Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ca64ffd7-b5f5-4d74-9fac-db75ed175cfb","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a7741c394a61d5aa4","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01FfpbXZm9QKgmxjWyMYAhaZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Pxng6azZQaRAvLy9FfKK9o","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html","prompt":"关于 symmetry_level 参数的细节：默认值、可选值、行为差异，以及对称性检测的时间限制。"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5279,"cache_read_input_tokens":27631,"output_tokens":348,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5279},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":348,"cache_read_input_tokens":27631,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5279,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5279,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaozbvF4j3AqZn3ymjFP7","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"0a912b44-dc78-4fa0-861c-f53b2a40bc32","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:25:52.382Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"0a912b44-dc78-4fa0-861c-f53b2a40bc32","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7","agentId":"a7741c394a61d5aa4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pxng6azZQaRAvLy9FfKK9o","type":"tool_result","content":"# CP-SAT Symmetry Parameter Details\n\nBased on the provided documentation, **the content does not contain specific information about a `symmetry_level` parameter**, its default values, optional settings, or behavior differences.\n\n## What the Documentation Does Cover\n\nThe primer mentions symmetry detection briefly in the presolve section:\n\n> \"[Symmetry] Symmetry computation done. time: 0.000374304... Found orbitope of size 6 x 2\"\n\nThis appears in a sample solver log, showing that CP-SAT automatically detects and exploits symmetries during presolve to reduce the search space.\n\n## Key Finding\n\nThe documentation emphasizes that **most parameters beyond basic ones like `max_time_in_seconds` should be left at defaults**, as they are \"well-chosen and tampering with them could disrupt optimizations.\"\n\nFor detailed `symmetry_level` specifications, you would need to consult the official OR-Tools repository, specifically the `sat_parameters.proto` file referenced in the primer."}]},"uuid":"3125363d-eec8-4004-a503-218b98dfd3a9","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:25:56.638Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0a912b44-dc78-4fa0-861c-f53b2a40bc32","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ca64ffd7-b5f5-4d74-9fac-db75ed175cfb","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7","agentId":"a7741c394a61d5aa4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018jdWd9Q1Bgv2B8UWPsGg3L","type":"tool_result","content":"# CP-SAT 对称检测与使用\n\n根据提供的代码文档，以下是关键信息：\n\n## 检测方法\n文件未提及外部工具调用。代码实现了 `SymmetryPropagator` 类来处理已检测到的对称性，但文档中没有说明对称检测本身的具体实现。\n\n## 核心算法\n实现基于学术论文策略：Devriendt 等人 2012 年的\"Symmetry Propagation: Improved Dynamic Symmetry Breaking in SAT\"。\n\n主要思路是：当某个文字被传播时，该类会尝试检测是否可以通过对称性也传播其他文字。具体而言，对每个排列，系统会计算\"第一个非对称文字\"——即在当前赋值下为真但其排列像为假的文字。\n\n## 关键限制\n- **增量性限制**：代码注释指出 `AddSymmetry()` \"目前只能在 `PropagateNext()` 被调用之前调用\"\n- **启发式策略**：文档明确指出该方法\"不是详尽的\"，不能检测所有可能的传播\n- **支撑集优化建议**：文件建议仅添加\"支撑尽可能小\"的排列生成元，而非全部排列\n\n文档未提及时间限制或外部对称检测工具的使用。"}]},"uuid":"f14a2756-ad90-4327-b95a-106e95ad91d4","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:25:59.085Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ca64ffd7-b5f5-4d74-9fac-db75ed175cfb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"f14a2756-ad90-4327-b95a-106e95ad91d4","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a7741c394a61d5aa4","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01QiKjtPnhT21cbJhjZFbJXp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"信息够了。现在产出报告。\n\n---\n\n# 调研报告：图自同构工具 + 自动对称破缺，2024-2026 进展\n\n## 1. 工具横评（nauty / Traces / bliss / saucy / dejavu）\n\n| 工具 | 强项 | 弱项 | 现状 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **nauty** | 小图 / 简单族最快 | 稠密图退化，不支持稀疏专用结构 | 2026-01 出 v2_9_3，仍由 McKay 维护 |\n| **Traces** | 复杂对称结构最强（与 nauty 同包） | 内存开销大 | 同上 |\n| **bliss** | 不相交分量类强 | 旧（2007），SCIP 10.0 已踢出默认包 | 仍可用，停滞 |\n| **saucy** | SAT/CSP 编码的稀疏图王者（DAC 2004 是它的主战场） | 不算 canonical labeling；只找对称群 | saucy3 是终态 |\n| **dejavu** | Monte Carlo 概率算法，44 个图族里有 32 族最快 | 概率算法（虽错误率可控） | 2024-2025 由 Anders/Schweitzer 持续推进，是当前 SOTA |\n| **sassy** | 不是求解器，是预处理器，砍掉稀疏大子结构 | 必须配合上面任一求解器 | SEA 2023 论文，已被 SCIP 9.0 集成（`sbliss`/`snauty` 选项）|\n\n**对你这种\"SAT/CSP 编码出来的稀疏图\"场景：saucy 或 sassy+dejavu 是首选**。nauty/Traces 偏组合学传统强项，bliss 已显老。\n\n## 2. SCIP-Symmetry 现状（最有参考价值的工业实践）\n\n- **SCIP 9.0（2024）**：彻底重构对称检测层，引入 sassy 预处理；orbital reduction 推广到非二元变量；orbital + lex reduction 可同时启用且互不冲突。\n- **SCIP 10.0（2025-12）**：bliss 不再随发行版打包，改用 nauty；新增 dejavu 接口。换言之，工业 MIP 求解器已经把\"图自同构 → MIP 对称群\"这条路完全产品化。\n- **手段**：lex-leader、orbisack/symresack、orbital fixing、orbital branching、isomorphism pruning。Margot 的难例上\"orbital fixing + orbital branching\"最快。\n\n## 3. CP-SAT 自动对称检测：已经有了，但不深\n\n- CP-SAT presolve **会自动**做对称检测，日志里直接能看到 `Found orbitope of size 6 x 2` 这种信息。\n- 控制开关是 `symmetry_level`（0/1/2/3）。**默认会跑，但有 1 秒确定性时间硬上限**；在大模型上经常超时被砍掉，需要 `symmetry_level:3` 强制开。GitHub issue #4419 还在讨论暴露时间上限。\n- 内部 `SymmetryPropagator` 实现的是 Devriendt 2012 dynamic symmetry propagation，不是 nauty/bliss 级的完整自同构计算——**只用支撑小的生成元**，明确\"非详尽\"。\n- **结论**：CP-SAT 自带的对称检测是\"轻量探测 + orbitope 识别\"，对 D₄ 这种几何对称未必能识别全；orbitope 主要捕捉行/列变量的列对称，对正方形 4 旋转 + 4 翻转的 D₄ 几何群覆盖不完整。\n\n## 4. master_model → colored graph 的可行性\n\n这是教科书做法（Margot, Salvagnin, Pfetsch 系列），SCIP/MOSEK 都用同一构造：\n- **变量节点**（颜色 = 目标系数 + 类型）\n- **约束节点**（颜色 = 右端常数 + 约束类型）\n- **边**（颜色 = 系数值；同系数同色）\n- 该图的自同构群 = MIP 公式的对称群\n\nCP-SAT 的 master 走 OR-Tools `CpModelProto` → 自己写一个 protobuf 遍历器 → 输出 dimacs/.dre 给 saucy/dejavu，**工程量约 300-500 行**，主要难点是：\n- 处理通道约束（reified、indicator）的颜色编码\n- bool/int 变量混用时颜色空间设计\n- AddElement、AddCircuit 这类全局约束要么展平要么单独编码\n\n## 5. 找到群之后的破缺方法\n\n按破缺强度由弱到强：\n1. **生成元 lex-leader**：每个生成元一条 `x ≤ σ(x)` lex 约束，最便宜，可能不完整破缺。\n2. **Schreier-Sims 完整破缺**：理论完备但约束爆炸，70x70 不可行。\n3. **orbital fixing**（动态）：分支时把 orbit 内未固定变量统一处理，效果最好，需要嵌入 CP-SAT 内部——CP-SAT 没暴露这个 hook，要靠静态约束模拟。\n4. **orbitope encoding**：行/列对称专用，CP-SAT 已经会识别。\n\n对你而言 D₄ 群只有 8 个元素，**生成元 lex-leader 完全够用**——加 2 条 lex 约束（一个旋转一个翻转的生成元），破缺率 ≥ 87.5%。\n\n## 6. 工程成本（实打实算）\n\n| 子任务 | 时间 |\n|---|---|\n| 写 CpModelProto → colored graph 导出器 | 1.5-2 天 |\n| 调通 saucy/dejavu CLI 接管 + 解析回 permutation | 0.5 天 |\n| 把 permutation 翻译回 CP-SAT 变量索引 + 加 lex 约束 | 1 天 |\n| 验证 D₄ 是否被识别 + 是否还有意外群 | 1 天 |\n| 集成进 master_model + 回归测试 + campaign 跑通 | 1.5 天 |\n| **合计** | **5-6 天**（约 1 周） |\n\n风险点：\n- 70x70 的 placement 模型变量数大概 2-5 万级，**编码后 colored graph 几十万节点没问题**，dejavu/saucy 都能处理。\n- AI 路径明确禁止改 master 语义，但**对称破缺约束属于 sound 约束（不删可行解）**，只要走 CR-PROOF 那条路（PROJECT_LOCK gate）就合规，不属于 AI sidecar 范畴。\n- 真正的不确定性：自动检测**很可能只发现已知的 D₄**，给的是负面结果（\"手工版本已最优\"），上限收益小。\n\n## 是否值得花 1 周做\n\n**不值得，建议降级为 0.5-1 天的探针实验**。\n\n理由：\n1. **手工已实现 99%**，剩 D₄ 即使靠工具发现，破缺方式仍是手写 lex 约束，省不了多少工作。\n2. **CP-SAT presolve 自带 orbitope 检测**，先把日志里 `symmetry_level:3` 开起来看一眼日志输出 orbitope/group order，**5 分钟就能判断它现在到底识别到了什么**——这是必做的零成本动作。\n3. **Phase 3B 的瓶颈不在对称破缺**。MEMORY 里你自己定的\"占比 <5% 就停手\"原则——D₄ 的 8 倍剪枝在 Benders 主问题上经过现有手工破缺后增益估计远低于 5%。\n4. **真要做也是 0.5 天探针**：把 master 当前 Round 跑出的 CpModelProto dump 出来，写个 50 行脚本调 dejavu 看群阶。如果发现意外群（>D₄）再升级到 1 周完整方案；如果只发现 D₄，结论\"手工已收敛\"直接归档。\n\n**推荐执行路径**：\n- 立刻：`symmetry_level:3` 开起来抓一份日志（10 分钟）\n- 短期：写 dump + dejavu 探针脚本（半天）\n- 仅当探针发现 |Aut| > 8 才进入 1 周工程化\n\n参考文献：\n- [SCIP 10.0 Optimization Suite (2025-11)](https://arxiv.org/html/2511.18580v1)\n- [SCIP 9.0 Optimization Suite (2024-02)](https://optimization-online.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/scipopt-90-2.pdf)\n- [SCIP Symmetry Doxygen](https://www.scipopt.org/scip/doc/html/SYMMETRY.php)\n- [dejavu / sassy 主页](https://automorphisms.org/)\n- [sassy preprocessor (SEA 2023)](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2302.06351)\n- [nauty + Traces 用户指南](https://users.cecs.anu.edu.au/~bdm/nauty/nug26.pdf)\n- [saucy3 主页](http://vlsicad.eecs.umich.edu/BK/SAUCY/)\n- [CP-SAT SymmetryPropagator API](https://developers.google.com/optimization/reference/sat/symmetry/SymmetryPropagator)\n- [CP-SAT symmetry time limit issue #4419](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4419)\n- [QUBO Formulations for MIP Symmetry Detection (2025-12)](https://arxiv.org/html/2512.15070)\n- [Algorithms Transcending the SAT-Symmetry Interface](https://arxiv.org/html/2306.00613)\n- [Margot: Symmetry in Integer Linear Programming](https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/Symmetry-in-Integer-Linear-Programming-Margot/9df2db1c2b2f788acbbad152630a91fdb5d76693)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":362,"cache_creation_input_tokens":808,"cache_read_input_tokens":32910,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":808,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CaozcsLU91BkLQR7HrFhF","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"118a4f49-e0f3-444b-8bcc-6ca0bffb49a7","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:27:14.338Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
